WEBVTT

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:04.440
Your Highness, here's your snack today.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.400
They're cream puffs.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:12.840
Thank you very much.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.140
I'll eat them now, then.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.100
Fluffy...

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:32.740
Fluffy...

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.910
Fluffy...

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:41.640
Fluffy.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.640
<b>Fluffy</b>

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.640
Fluffy. Fluffy. Fluffy.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:49.020
Fluffy.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.990
<i>Mullin was worried about something again.</i>

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:35.900
<i>Her Highness is getting even more lazy!</i>

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:39.680
<i>There's even more fluffy 
things in her office now...</i>

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:40.130
<b>* 5 minute break</b>

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.650
So fluffy.

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:52.770
<b>Brother Tastes like a Fairy Tale.</b>

00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:02.320
Perhaps my inability to do my job well is 
exacerbating what's happening to her Highness.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:04.700
I need to do better.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.540
I need to make sure she can depend on me—

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:14.630
I'm going to fall...

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:16.920
<i>So much for dependable.</i>

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:40.660
<i>He's...</i>

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.930
<i>He's so cool!</i>

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:52.040
<i>This is the ideal I should be striving for!</i>

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.670
<i>A trained body.</i>

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:57.540
<i>A man of action.</i>

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.730
<i>And such a sharp gaze.</i>

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:01.790
<i>A masculine man that 
doesn't need to say much.</i>

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:02.420
Are you okay?

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:03.280
Huh?

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:09.350
Are you okay? Are you hurt? 
You should watch your step.

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:06.800
<i>Wait. He is saying a lot...</i>

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:09.350
<i>And quite eloquently.</i>

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.180
Th-Thank you.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.360
I'm glad you're not hurt.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:18.770
So cool.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:22.500
<i>He's a nice person, too.</i>

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:28.240
<b>101 Dogs
of Flanders</b>

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:26.680
<i>What's this?</i>

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:28.240
Emotional

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.580
Here you are...

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:38.040
Thanks

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.040
<i>He's a really nice person.</i>

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:41.900
Bro, what's your name?

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.820
Where are you stationed?

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:46.140
You don't know who I am?

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:50.620
Sorry, I'm from the middle of 
nowhere, and I just got here...

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:51.970
<b>Embarrassed...</b>

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.430
(Woof...)

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.400
Hold on a second!

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.320
My name is Mullin!

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:02.460
I wanna be a good man like you!

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:09.330
<b>Leave me alone.
You'll just be disappointed.</b>

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:09.330
So cool!

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:11.980
Bro! Hold—

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:15.980
Ow... I scraped myself...

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:17.950
<i>A rabbit bandage?!</i>

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:21.740
<i>Time for lunch.</i>

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:24.380
In any event, I'll just 
try copying how he acts.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.090
My usual

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:26.810
<i>So cool!</i>

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:27.830
<i>He's asking for his usual!</i>

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:29.600
<i>He's like a manly adult!</i>

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:32.070
I'll take the same thing!

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:33.460
Coming right up.

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:35.000
<i>A manly lunch...</i>

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.840
<i>I bet there's gonna be tons of meat.</i>

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:39.240
<i>Steak, katsudon, yakiniku...</i>

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:41.070
<i>I bet it's liver stir-fry.</i>

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:43.530
Here you are.

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:46.370
<i>Pancakes...</i>

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:47.690
<i>I guess he likes sweet things.</i>

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:49.400
<i>Didn't exactly picture that.</i>

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:53.580
No!

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.400
<i>He's upset!</i>

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:54.230
<i>He's super upset!</i>

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:55.870
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:56.660
Hold on a second.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:58.240
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

00:05:58.240 --> 00:05:58.960
<i>She just messed up—</i>

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.290
Sorry about that.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.030
<i>So cute!</i>

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:03.460
<i>Much better.</i>

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.130
Chew Chew

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:13.440
Um...

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:16.060
How did you get so big like that?

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:19.530
Did you work out real hard, or...

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:21.760
Actually, is working out just 
something you like doing?

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:26.070
I collect bears.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:27.780
Bears?!

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:29.530
<i>Really cool!</i>

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:32.480
Do you do tigers, too?!

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:36.750
I know it's obscure, 
but I do have some elephants.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.710
<i>He goes big!</i>

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:41.460
I'm into needlework lately, too.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.460
<i>Like torture?!</i>

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.420
<i>This guy is for real.</i>

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.880
Wanna come to my room 
if your so interested?

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:52.720
Bro, I'm sorry! I'm just 
not that hardcore yet...

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:55.440
I'm sorry! Spare me!

00:06:57.090 --> 00:06:58.680
<i>He calmed down.</i>

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:05.770
<i>He's completely into girly stuff...</i>

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:13.360
<i>I mean I kind of suspected it,</i>

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:16.160
<i>but he's not what I had imagined.</i>

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:23.540
They're vintage. The stuffed animals from 
the 1930s are so wonderfully cute.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:23.540
I have bears and elephants, 
but the rabbits are super cute, too.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:30.130
Do you think I'm weird now?

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:29.990
Huh?

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:36.260
I thought you understood me.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:36.260
Did you try to trick me?

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:34.200
No!

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:35.000
Don't cry!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.260
Don't cry, Bro!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:43.850
That's why I told you to stay away from me.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:43.850
I don't want to disappoint others,
and I'm not great at communicating.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:45.980
So that's why you use those boards...

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:50.440
I look fierce, too.

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:50.440
You're not scared of me?

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:50.440
I'm starting to think of you as more cute.

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:52.360
Don't cry!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:54.680
Did you make this, Bro?

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:56.800
You make your own stuffed animals, huh?!

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:00.120
A friend asked me to make that...

00:07:57.890 --> 00:07:59.500
Huh? A friend?

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:03.930
Azazel, did you finish that stuffed animal?

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:04.980
<i>It's her Highness...</i>

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.160
So you two know each other.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.470
Not just know each other.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:14.720
This is the former cherub​, Azazel.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:23.440
<b>Former Cherub​, the Demon
Azazel</b>

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:17.830
He's as ancient a demon as 
I in all of Pandemonium,

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:23.440
and he's part of The Watchers, 
which maintain order here in Hell.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.040
He's that impressive?!

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:31.900
I have Azazel make me 
stuffed animals sometimes.

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:35.740
Such great softness.

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:40.480
I'm amazed you can make things like this.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:51.960
You're not disappointed?

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:48.690
Huh?

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.960
That I'm into this sort of thing...?

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:54.340
Of course not.

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:57.430
I mean, you didn't really look 
like this would be your thing,

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.780
and that was kind of surprising, 
but I'm not disappointed.

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:01.910
I like cute things, too.

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.940
Thank you!!

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:14.730
H-Hey, Bro— I mean, Azazel-san.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:16.560
You're going to break me...

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:19.370
Ow...

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:24.020
Mullin is my assistant.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.480
What's wrong?

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:27.380
He knows that.

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:29.280
Mullin is my assistant.

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.600
He knows that.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.270
He's my assistant!

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:34.830
What's gotten into you?

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:38.700
<i>So that's how Azazel got to know Mullin...</i>

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:43.350
<b>The next day</b>

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.350
The usual.

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:47.890
The usual.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.330
Coming right up.

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:54.550
<i>It's possible you can get in 
shape by eating the same thing.</i>

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:58.110
<i>And so Mullin, at least, 
kept trying to improve.</i>

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.340
Here you are.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.420
<i>The Secret Garden</i>, huh?

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:20.300
The clothes from that era
were quite astounding.

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:23.090
I've never really read this through.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.270
They'd look great on Beelzebub.

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:30.480
You're right!

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.990
Would you like to wear stuff like that, too?

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.950
Do fans of idols wear the clothes 
of that which they worship?

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:40.950
Makes sense.

00:10:48.050 --> 00:10:51.290
<i>Being with him sure is helpful in learning.</i>

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:56.200
<i>Hm? Someone's in front of the office.</i>

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:04.060
<i>She's pretty cute.</i>

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:11.960
Do you need something from her Highness?

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.030
What's wrong?

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:22.890
She's shaking a lot.

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:24.120
She's completely red.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:25.630
Is she not feeling well?

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:29.000
Gocchin?

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.370
Bel!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:32.620
<b>Grab</b>

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:33.630
<b>And</b>

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:40.880
<b>Throw in Washroom</b>

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:38.710
<b>Bel,
thank you!</b>

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:40.880
What?!

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:49.350
<b>She's Here, Vibration Girl.</b>

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.770
Mullin, this is the former 
Principality, the demon, Belphegor.

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:59.400
<b>Former Principality,
The Demon
Belphegor</b>

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:02.370
I-I'm sorry about that.

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:05.660
You were a guy, and I don't 
know you, so I was scared...

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.990
I should have been scared.

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:10.770
Anyway, are you okay?

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:11.880
You're still shaking.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:13.170
Are you sick?

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:15.450
She's fine, Mullin.

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:18.220
Gocchin has serious social anxiety.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:22.200
So when she gets nervous or anxious,

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:24.760
she feels like she has to urinate...

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:26.470
Stop it, Bel!

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.060
You're embarrassing me—

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:34.050
Well, urination is a natural occurrence.

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:35.850
You can't just hold it in, so...

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:39.280
Yeah, but if I try hard I can—

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:42.960
Don't worry about me.

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:46.540
I can hold it in like this...

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:57.790
<i>I feel like I really 
shouldn't be watching this.</i>

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.040
<i>Time to leave.</i>

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:03.190
Must be tough for you, Belphegor-san.

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:05.840
Y-You can call me Gocchin.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:09.350
Everyone calls me Belphegossan or Gocchin.

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:11.850
Okay, then I'll call you Gocchin-san—

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:14.680
Gotta go to the bathroom!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.570
Are you okay?

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.990
Gotta go to the bathroom!

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:26.860
Um.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:31.830
<i>I can't even talk to her!</i>

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:34.870
<b>The Endlessly Urinating Demon
Belphegor</b>

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:37.670
<b>The Endlessly Urinating Demon
Gocchin</b>

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:39.050
Bathroom!

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:48.050
What is it, your Highness?

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:53.890
Why are you blushing because 
Gocchin has to go to the bathroom?

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:57.060
That's what I want to know!

00:13:58.720 --> 00:14:00.340
<i>Pure eyes.</i>

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:07.440
So, Gocchin-san, what is it that you need?

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:09.610
Bel asked me to come.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.040
Bro!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.450
Excuse me.

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:18.020
What is it?

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:19.330
Do you need something?

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:23.170
Beelzebub asked me to come.

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:25.880
Azaze...

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:31.820
<i>She's super afraid of him...</i>

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:33.510
<i>She keeps looking this way.</i>

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.890
Gocchin-san, it's okay.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:37.850
Bro isn't scary.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.460
Come on, you say something, too.

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:43.360
Belphegor...

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:47.570
<i>She's totally going to wet herself!</i>

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:52.260
Gocchin...

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:55.740
Scared her again...

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:56.900
Again?

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:04.040
Whenever she sees me, 
she get scared and runs away.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:04.040
She's scared of me.

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:05.800
Bro...

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:15.600
I hear that Belphegor has to 
go to the restroom a lot.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:15.600
I knitted something to warm her up 
so her core doesn't get so cold.

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:13.900
Bro, are you a mom or something?

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:15.600
<i>Stay warm.</i>

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:19.680
Bro...

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.060
I'm going to get Gocchin-san!

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:28.180
I need to tell her how nice you are!

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:31.800
Bro...

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:36.530
It's okay.

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:36.530
I don't want to scare her
more than she already is.

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.170
But...

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:41.250
I feel bad she has the wrong idea about you!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:49.840
Thanks for feeling that way, but...

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:43.740
Bro...

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:46.230
Hey, Azazel...

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:49.840
It might be better to make 
your appearance less scary.

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:01.850
<b>Cute</b>

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.350
Wait. This isn't right.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.350
This is not right!!!!

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:06.130
<i>I thought he'd be less scary with 
a bunch of cute things on, but...</i>

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:08.110
I told you!!

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:08.110
It's not just the clothes!!

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.110
<i>He did what he could, but...</i>

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:10.070
Excuse me.

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:11.860
Your Highness, it's time for your meeting.

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:17.620
<b>Ahhhh</b>

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:15.130
Mullin, save me...

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:16.560
You go, your Highness!

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:17.620
Leave the rest to me!

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:19.200
All right...

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.940
Okay, smile, Bro!

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:21.940
Smile!

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:25.310
Smiling is the best way
to make yourself approachable!

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:31.630
Th-This is hard.

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:31.630
It's hard to smile on command.

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:31.630
Think about something happy!

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:34.840
Something happy...

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:43.730
I'm a bit tired after that today...

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:58.910
Welcome home.

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:04.370
Good work again today, and...

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:08.460
thank you for making us so cute!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:25.560
Something happy...

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:29.770
You're supposed to show 
how happy you are, Bro!

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.480
Let's see...

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:36.080
Things girls don't like about guys...

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.440
Their voice being too loud...

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:38.670
Being yelled at...

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:40.330
Using sharp language...

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:45.410
I think any gender wouldn't 
like those things.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.410
Bro, let's soften your language.

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:46.410
I don't even talk, though.

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:48.450
Oh, right.

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:49.880
In that case...

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:51.840
Meow.

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:54.620
How about saying cute things on those boards?

00:17:54.620 --> 00:18:00.850
Cute?

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:57.970
Like "meow"?

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:00.850
Are you serious?

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:02.810
Meow.

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:09.770
Are you serious? Meow.

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:08.540
Bro...

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:09.770
You're so nice.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.760
This is hard.

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:22.580
Sorry.

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:18.730
This isn't your fault.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:23.080
What can you do to be liked by girls?!

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:25.600
What don't they like about you, anyway?!

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:27.160
Aren't you liked by girls?

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:31.130
I haven't gotten Valentine's Day
chocolates from anyone but my mom.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:40.090
You can have this...

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:40.090
<b>Bro
made
it
himself.</b>

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.190
It's fine.

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:38.250
<i>Kindness and sadness mixed.</i>

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.640
<i>Keep your chin up, Mullin.</i>

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:48.160
<i>I couldn't help at all.</i>

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:57.530
Thanks for everything.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:57.530
Take these for helping out.
There's some for Beelzebub, too.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:06.240
These are good!

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:07.760
They're super good.

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:09.950
Bro, you're so cool.

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:12.670
U-Um, Mullin-kun.

00:19:13.780 --> 00:19:15.050
Gocchin-san!

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.510
U-Um...

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:20.770
Um...

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:24.800
A-Azazel-sama wasn't mad, was he?

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:27.240
I was so nervous...

00:19:27.240 --> 00:19:30.670
W-Wait. He wouldn't get mad.

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:33.350
<i>How scared is she of him...</i>

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:33.770
<i>I know.</i>

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:35.510
Take these.

00:19:35.990 --> 00:19:37.980
They're cookies that he made.

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:39.500
I'll give you a bag.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.880
Azazel-sama made them?

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:43.740
Yep.

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:54.380
I'm happy.

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:03.710
I'm going to treasure these.

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:07.710
I couldn't bring myself to eat them.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:14.270
Pyaaaaa

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:21.360
Does Gocchin-san...

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:25.570
...like cookies that much?!

00:20:27.060 --> 00:20:34.860
<i>Mullin just hasn't figured out yet why 
Belphegor gets so anxious in front of Azazel...</i>

00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:49.980
Fluffy.

00:22:51.720 --> 00:22:53.570
Fluffy.

00:22:55.510 --> 00:22:57.180
Fluffy.

00:22:57.180 --> 00:23:05.110
Fluffy.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Former Angel with Wings.</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>The Assistant, a Complete Sadist.</b>

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:37.890
Please watch us next time.
